## File responsibilities

| File | Contains |
|---|---|
| `_variables.scss` | `$menu-breakpoint-key`, colours, spacing, thumb size, z-index |
| `_mixins.scss` | `breakpoint-menu-up/down`, panel visibility, a11y helpers |
| `_structure.scss` | Lists, flex rows, panel positioning skeleton |
| `_desktop.scss` | Nav row, align-right, mega panel shell, `[aria-expanded]` |
| `_mobile-drawer.scss` | Drawer panels, drill-down, chevrons |
| `_layout-patterns/*` | Pattern A/B/C grid rules only |
| `_link-types/*` | One partial per ACF `link_type` |
| `_animations.scss` | Staggered column reveal on open |

---

## What not to port from shineon

- Tab/block/cards link-type partials (not in Figma)
- `breakpoint-menu-up` wired to `large` — **wrong breakpoint for Chairforce**
- Generic `.header-nav` / `.mobile-menu` selectors
- Hover-only mega menu reveal without `aria-expanded` / `.is-open`

